<title>USA: Northwestern Steel names new officer.</title>
<headline>Northwestern Steel names new officer.</headline>
<dateline>STERLING, Ill. 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Northwestern Steel &amp; Wire Co said Monday it named Richard Way as president and chief operating officer.</p>
<p>Way joined Northwestern in 1994 and most recently served as senior vice president of sterling operations.</p>
<p>Robert Gurnitz previously served as president and remains as chairman and chief executive officer of Northwestern. The position of chief operating officer was newly created.</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
